'''Barry Center''' is a sub-location of the {{zone|Village Plaza}} in the [[Rift Dimension]]. It is based on the {{zone|Community Center}}.

== Features ==
'''Barry Center''' features a few attractions.

=== Protestors ===
{{See also|Barry}}
There are {{Green|7}} protestors that can be found in the '''Barry Center'''. After reporting their complaints to [[Barry]], the player must then resolve the complaints. After doing so, each protestor will move to the {{zone|Barry HQ}}.

=== Detransfigured Seraphine ===
{{Main|Detransfigured Seraphine}}
After resolving all the protestors complaints, [[Detransfigured Seraphine]] will appear. She will ask the player to transfigure her, at which point the player must splash Seraphine with an {{Item|Anti-Morph Potion}}. After doing so, she will turn into [[Transfigured Seraphine]] and offer the player a {{Item|Used Detransfigured Face}}.

